# Maintenance line (MT-1..MT-7) review, 2026-10-04

Evidence for `docs/maintenance-line-review-2026-10-04.md`. Every command below was run
today on a Linux x86_64 host at HEAD `058726e5`, whose working tree additionally carried
the Windows LSP fix described in section 10. Section 9 is the release-gate half of the
